# Everything the site serves. The editor runs entirely client-side over
# localStorage, so there is no frame-embedding story to support and nothing
# downstream that needs a referrer. A full CSP is deliberately not here: the
# SvelteKit init script is inline, so a real policy is its own considered
# change, not a header to sprinkle.
/*
  x-content-type-options: nosniff
  x-frame-options: DENY
  referrer-policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/_app/immutable/*
  cache-control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
